{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 20, :comments ["<b>Arise.</b> The sense of <i>arise</i> — to demonstrate His might and strength." "<b>Enosh.</b> A species name, like: \"I had ox and donkey\" (Genesis 32:5). And the correct reading: \"the King\" — therefore He said, the nations are His servants."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 9, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:26:47.923534997Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}